{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"66b90806850c7472f9eeb58c","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski%40oss.qualcomm.com/","channels":["linux-arm-msm"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski%40oss.qualcomm.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com"},"subject":"[PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: monaco: add PMIC PON with power key","messages":{"20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com":{"id":"20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com","messageId":"20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com","references":[],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Milosz Wasilewski","address":"milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"},{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Milosz Wasilewski","address":"milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T15:26:10.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T15:26:10.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: monaco: add PMIC PON with power key","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Monaco has no PMIC PON node, so the power key is not described at all\nand there is no pwrkey input device.  More importantly the board then\nhas no power-key wakeup source: the only way out of s2idle is the RTC\nalarm or one of the PCIe/USB/remoteproc sources, and pressing the power\nbutton does nothing."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Add the PON node with the power key, modelled on the pmm8654au PON on\nlemans, which carries the same PMIC: the block lives at 0x1200 and its\ninterrupts are on block 0x12."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"qcom,pmk8350-pwrkey has wakeup_source_default set, so the driver arms\nthe IRQ as a wakeup source without any additional DT property."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"On an IQ-8275-EVK this gives a pmic_pwrkey input device under\nc440000.spmi:pmic@0:pon@1200, and:"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"  # grep pwrkey /sys/kernel/debug/wakeup_sources\n  c440000.spmi:pmic@0:pon@1200:pwrkey"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"\"systemctl suspend\" followed by a power-key press now resumes the board,\nwhere before it stayed in s2idle until an RTC alarm fired."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5\nSigned-off-by: Milosz Wasilewski <milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com:0:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com:0:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[]}},"rootIds":["20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{"patch:20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com:0:0":{"id":"patch:20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com:0:0","messageId":"20260814152610.2039318-1-milosz.wasilewski@oss.qualcomm.com","subject":"[PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: monaco: add PMIC PON with power key","commitMessage":[],"files":[{"oldPath":"arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-pmics.dtsi","newPath":"arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-pmics.dtsi","displayPath":"arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-pmics.dtsi","status":"modified","hunks":[{"header":"@@ -14,6 +14,19 @@ pmm8620au_0: pmic@0 {","oldStart":14,"oldCount":6,"newStart":14,"newCount":19,"lines":[{"kind":"context","text":"\t\t#address-cells = <1>;","oldLine":14,"newLine":14},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\t#size-cells = <0>;","oldLine":15,"newLine":15},{"kind":"context","text":"","oldLine":16,"newLine":16},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\tpmm8620au_0_pon: pon@1200 {","newLine":17},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\tcompatible = \"qcom,pmk8350-pon\";","newLine":18},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\treg = <0x1200>, <0x800>;","newLine":19},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\treg-names = \"hlos\", \"pbs\";","newLine":20},{"kind":"addition","text":"","newLine":21},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\tpmm8620au_0_pon_pwrkey: pwrkey {","newLine":22},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\t\tcompatible = \"qcom,pmk8350-pwrkey\";","newLine":23},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\t\tinterrupts = <0x0 0x12 0x7 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_BOTH>;","newLine":24},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\t\tlinux,code = <KEY_POWER>;","newLine":25},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\t\tdebounce = <15625>;","newLine":26},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t\t};","newLine":27},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t};","newLine":28},{"kind":"addition","text":"","newLine":29},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\tpmm8620au_0_rtc: rtc@6100 {","oldLine":17,"newLine":30},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\t\tcompatible = \"qcom,pmk8350-rtc\";","oldLine":18,"newLine":31},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\t\treg = <0x6100>, <0x6200>;","oldLine":19,"newLine":32},{"kind":"metadata","text":""},{"kind":"metadata","text":"base-commit: ed2647532a225739e86c7f236a2ce82764ec2772"},{"kind":"deletion","text":"- ","oldLine":20},{"kind":"metadata","text":"2.43.0"},{"kind":"metadata","text":""},{"kind":"metadata","text":""}]}],"binary":false}],"trailers":[],"rawText":"diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-pmics.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-pmics.dtsi\nindex 6e096b9b7546..aeaef002f791 100644\n--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-pmics.dtsi\n+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-pmics.dtsi\n@@ -14,6 +14,19 @@ pmm8620au_0: pmic@0 {\n \t\t#address-cells = <1>;\n \t\t#size-cells = <0>;\n \n+\t\tpmm8620au_0_pon: pon@1200 {\n+\t\t\tcompatible = \"qcom,pmk8350-pon\";\n+\t\t\treg = <0x1200>, <0x800>;\n+\t\t\treg-names = \"hlos\", \"pbs\";\n+\n+\t\t\tpmm8620au_0_pon_pwrkey: pwrkey {\n+\t\t\t\tcompatible = \"qcom,pmk8350-pwrkey\";\n+\t\t\t\tinterrupts = <0x0 0x12 0x7 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_BOTH>;\n+\t\t\t\tlinux,code = <KEY_POWER>;\n+\t\t\t\tdebounce = <15625>;\n+\t\t\t};\n+\t\t};\n+\n \t\tpmm8620au_0_rtc: rtc@6100 {\n \t\t\tcompatible = \"qcom,pmk8350-rtc\";\n \t\t\treg = <0x6100>, <0x6200>;\n\nbase-commit: ed2647532a225739e86c7f236a2ce82764ec2772\n-- \n2.43.0\n\n","statistics":{"files":1,"additions":13,"deletions":1},"diagnostics":[]}}}}